  owners and delivery leads\, with a real work package run live.\n\nOrganis
 er: Agile Breakfast Zürich (swissICT)\n\nDetails and registration: https:
 //swissdataevents.ch/events/agile-breakfast-zurich-viele-agenten-2026/
